    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breathless Hope\u00a0</strong>is a first-person horror and action game set in a peripheral area forgotten by the government and completely isolated after a deadly outbreak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive and help your neighbors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the blockade, you\u2019ll have to survive on your own. Most of your neighbors are either infected or locked inside their homes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every decision matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make tough choices that will shape the storyline. Would you help a neighbor who wronged you in the past? Your choices matter and could mean the difference between life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't lose your breath</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run for your life, avoid getting caught, and show no mercy \u2013 because the monsters you face certainly won't. When tired, stop and rest \u2013 or take an energy drink \u2013 otherwise, you\u2019ll become easy prey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark alleys in search of supplies to help others and yourself. But be cautious when turning a corner, as something may be lurking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember: In this game, haste is the enemy of survival.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breathless Hope\u00a0</strong>is a first-person horror and action game set in a peripheral area forgotten by the government and completely isolated after a deadly outbreak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive and help your neighbors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the blockade, you\u2019ll have to survive on your own. Most of your neighbors are either infected or locked inside their homes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every decision matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make tough choices that will shape the storyline. Would you help a neighbor who wronged you in the past? Your choices matter and could mean the difference between life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't lose your breath</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run for your life, avoid getting caught, and show no mercy \u2013 because the monsters you face certainly won't. When tired, stop and rest \u2013 or take an energy drink \u2013 otherwise, you\u2019ll become easy prey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark alleys in search of supplies to help others and yourself. But be cautious when turning a corner, as something may be lurking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember: In this game, haste is the enemy of survival.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A bloody outbreak strikes a poor neighborhood. Isolated by the government, residents are left to fend for themselves as ravenous monsters roam the narrow streets. Survive this first-person horror action game, making choices that can mean the difference between life and death.",
